    LTEXT           "7) Set the value 5.0 hg in pitot pressure leak test and press Go on ADTS.",IDC_STATIC,25,132,249,9
    LTEXT           "9) Click Continue button to proceed for the next Test.",IDC_STATIC,23,195,174,9
