    LTEXT           "5) Interface the Ps port of ADC with Ps port of ADTS via pneumatic tube.",IDC_STATIC,25,101,244,9
    LTEXT           "8) Wait for 1 min to perform the leak test and enter the leak value.",IDC_STATIC,25,148,226,8
END

